{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02767","headline":"三月曲水宴得尊字 · 卢照邻","name":"三月曲水宴得尊字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风烟彭泽里，山水仲长园。\n由来弃铜墨，本自重琴尊。\n高情邈不嗣，雅道今复存。\n有美光时彦，养德坐山樊。\n门开芳杜迳，室距桃花源。\n公子黄金勒，仙人紫气轩。\n长怀去城市，高咏狎兰荪。\n连沙飞白鹭，孤屿啸玄猿。\n日影岩前落，云花江上翻。\n兴兰车马散，林塘夕鸟喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}